---
import PostLayout from '../../layouts/PostLayout.astro';
---
<!--
  ============================================================
  AUSTRALIA POST TEMPLATE
  ============================================================
  How to use this file:
  1. Fill in the PostLayout props at the top (title, description, dates, etc.)
  2. Replace every [PLACEHOLDER] with your own words
  3. For images: change the filename inside url('/images/YOUR-PHOTO.jpg')
  4. Delete any Day sections or tip boxes you don't need
  5. Add more Day sections by copying the Day block and pasting it
  6. When done, rename this file if you want (e.g. australia-sydney.astro)
  ============================================================
-->
<PostLayout
  title="Australia | J Wanders Off Again"
  description="[ONE OR TWO SENTENCES — what was this trip about? This shows in Google and when shared on social.]"
  ogUrl="https://jwandersoffagain.pages.dev/posts/australia"
  ogImage="https://jwandersoffagain.pages.dev/images/[YOUR-BEST-PHOTO].jpg"
  articlePublishedTime="[YYYY-MM-DD]"
  articleTags={["Australia", "Travel", "[TRIP TYPE — e.g. Family Trip / Girls Trip / Romantic Getaway / Solo]"]}
  pinterestDescription="[SHORT DESCRIPTION — one punchy sentence for Pinterest/social sharing]"
  heroImage="/images/[YOUR-HERO-PHOTO].jpg"
  heroImagePosition="center center"
  tag="[EMOJI] [TRIP TYPE] · Australia"
  headline="Australia"
  headlineEmphasis="[SHORT SUBTITLE — e.g. 'a trip we almost didn't take.']"
  date="[Month Year]"
  readTime="[X] min read"
  closingLine="[CLOSING LINE — a warm send-off to the reader. Look at the LA or NYC post for inspiration.]"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       INTRO
       Set the scene. Who went? Why this trip? What
       headspace were you in? Aim for 2-4 paragraphs.
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <p>[Opening paragraph. Who were you with? What was the occasion? Why Australia, why now? Let the reader in before diving into the days.]</p>

  <p>[Second paragraph. More context — what did you need from this trip? What were you expecting? This is where your voice comes through.]</p>

  <p>[Optional third paragraph. Ease into it — something that signals "okay, let's get into it." Even one line works here.]</p>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       DAY 1
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">Day 1</div>
    <h2>[Day 1 title — what was the main thing? <em>e.g. "Arrival &amp; Finding Our Feet"</em></h2>
  </div>

  <p>[What happened when you arrived? First impressions — the smell, the noise, the vibe. Where did you go first? Write 2–3 paragraphs before dropping a photo.]</p>

  <p>[More detail — where did you go, what did you eat, what surprised you? Be specific. Not "the food was good" but what exactly made it good.]</p>

  <!-- Single image. Change the filename. -->
  <div class="post-img" style="background-image:url('/images/[DAY1-PHOTO].jpg'); background-position: center center;" role="img" aria-label="[Brief description for accessibility]"></div>
  <p class="post-img-caption">[Caption — add something the photo doesn't already say. A thought, a feeling, a joke.]</p>

  <p>[Continue the day's story. What was the highlight? What was unexpected? What were you thinking while you were there?]</p>

  <!-- Optional tip box. Delete if you don't need it. -->
  <div class="post-tip">
    <div class="post-tip-label">✦ [Tip label — e.g. "Worth knowing" / "Would I do this again?" / "Money tip"]</div>
    <p>[Your honest take. One short paragraph. Direct and real.]</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       DAY 2
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">Day 2</div>
    <h2>[Day 2 title]</h2>
  </div>

  <p>[How did the day start? What was the plan vs what actually happened?]</p>

  <p>[The main event of the day. Describe it properly — not just what you did but how it felt.]</p>

  <!-- Side-by-side image pair. Use when two photos tell one story together. -->
  <!-- Or replace with a single image (delete one of the inner divs and the post-img-grid wrapper) -->
  <div class="post-img-grid">
    <div class="post-img" style="background-image:url('/images/[DAY2-PHOTO-A].jpg'); background-position: center center;" role="img" aria-label="[Description]"></div>
    <div class="post-img" style="background-image:url('/images/[DAY2-PHOTO-B].jpg'); background-position: center center;" role="img" aria-label="[Description]"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="post-img-caption">[Caption for the pair — one sentence that covers both.]</p>

  <p>[Continue the day. Was there a moment that stood out — good or bad? Don't shy away from the honest bits.]</p>

  <p>[Wrap up the day. How did it end? What were you feeling?]</p>

  <!-- Optional second tip box. Delete if not needed. -->
  <div class="post-tip">
    <div class="post-tip-label">⚠️ [Warning or practical tip]</div>
    <p>[Practical advice — something someone planning this trip would actually want to know.]</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       DAY 3 (copy and paste this block for more days)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">Day 3</div>
    <h2>[Day 3 title]</h2>
  </div>

  <p>[Day 3 content.]</p>

  <div class="post-img" style="background-image:url('/images/[DAY3-PHOTO].jpg'); background-position: center center;" role="img" aria-label="[Description]"></div>
  <p class="post-img-caption">[Caption]</p>

  <p>[Continue.]</p>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       WHERE WE STAYED (optional — include if useful)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">Where we stayed</div>
    <h2>[Hotel/accommodation name] — <em>the honest review</em></h2>
  </div>

  <p>[What was the accommodation like? Location, service, value for money. What would you tell a friend before they booked?]</p>

  <!-- Optional warning tip -->
  <div class="post-tip">
    <div class="post-tip-label">⚠️ One thing to know</div>
    <p>[Anything a future guest should be aware of — parking, noise, missing amenities, etc.]</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       WOULD I GO BACK?
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">The honest bit</div>
    <h2>Would I go back?</h2>
  </div>

  <p>[Your honest reflection. Would you go back? Would you do it differently? Was it what you needed? 2–3 paragraphs is plenty.]</p>

  <p>[Who would you recommend this trip for? Budget level? Time of year? This is where the post becomes genuinely useful to someone planning their own trip.]</p>

  <!-- Optional personal/emotional note. Delete if this post doesn't call for one. -->
  <div class="post-tip post-tip-blush">
    <div class="post-tip-label">🌸 A personal note</div>
    <p>[Optional. If something on this trip connected to a bigger feeling — about travel, about yourself, about life — this is the place. You don't have to use this every time.]</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-divider"><div class="post-divider-line"></div><div class="post-divider-mark">✦</div><div class="post-divider-line"></div></div>


  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       COST BREAKDOWN
       Always include this — it's one of the most
       useful and distinctive things about your blog.
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="post-section">
    <div class="post-section-label">What it cost</div>
    <h2>The full breakdown</h2>
  </div>

  <table class="cost-table">
    <tr><th>What</th><th>CAD</th><th>AUD</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Flights</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Accommodation — [name], [X] nights</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td>[Activity or experience]</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td>[Food / restaurant]</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td>[Transport — Uber / train / etc.]</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td>[Add or remove rows as needed]</td><td>$[amount]</td><td>$[amount]</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Total</strong></td><td><strong>~$[total]</strong></td><td><strong>~$[total]</strong></td></tr>
  </table>

  <p>[One or two sentences after the table — any context that helps the number make sense. Was it a splurge? Did you save somewhere? What wasn't included?]</p>

  <!-- Optional money tip box -->
  <div class="post-tip">
    <div class="post-tip-label">💸 The exchange rate reality</div>
    <p>[How did the CAD to AUD rate affect you? Any tips on how you managed money — Wise, credit cards, cash, etc.?]</p>
  </div>

</PostLayout>
